:INFO
Art. 66 Responsibility
The sponsor is responsible for the accuracy and completeness of the data entered.
|

:INFO
Art. 67 Portal
1 The FOPH shall operate a portal ensuring public access to information on clinical trials conducted in Switzerland via online access to one or more registries.
2 The portal shall enable in particular the linking of data to be entered under Articles 64 and 65a, as well as Articles 41 and 42 ClinO-MD, and the publication of this and other data from the cantonal information system as specified in Annex 5.
|

